      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        China's transport system is one of the most efficient in the world. <strong>High-speed rail</strong> is the best option between cities. <strong>Metro</strong> is fastest within cities. <strong>DiDi</strong> is most convenient for door-to-door trips. Everything can be paid with Alipay or WeChat Pay — no cash needed.
      </p>
